---
/** Dial: a knob on a sheet: a round track filled with ink to the pearl thumb, and the figure in the middle. */
---

<span class="cover-sheet cover-center" style="width:168px; padding:16px">
  <span class="cover-dial" style="--fill:.62">
    <i class="cover-bar cover-bar-figure cover-bar-strong" style="position:relative; width:28px"></i>
    <i class="cover-knob"></i>
  </span>
</span>
